; pseudorandom.hl - a linear congruential generator: s = 5s + 1, forever
; The multiply by 5 compiles to the hardware's ADD chain (ADD s four
; times). Full period by Hull-Dobell (a = 5 is 1 mod 4, c = 1 odd),
; so the outputs are a permutation of every byte 0..255 - the
; closest thing to randomness this machine can make without XOR.
var s = 1
while 1:
    s = s * 5 + 1
    out s
